    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "GreyThroat?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "He..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "If I recall correctly, he was the crossbowman with Mephisto, and one of Reunion's commanders."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...You knew him?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I don't know. I'm not sure if you'd say we... knew each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "It seems like there's not much Rhodes Island can do.;......;Have we ever actually saved any Infected?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "This is how it is for Rhodes Island... most of the time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But even if there's only the tiniest bit we can do, we will do it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "We have to."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "What are you thinking, Doctor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Are you thinking about... all the death we've seen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I can't guess. And I don't want to take it from your mind."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Because... I think one day you'll tell me yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "The operators have put in the work."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But death makes a heavy impression, heavier than saving someone. Every time we witness such death, it hits hard."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Just remember that without the efforts of our operators, we'd be seeing a lot more death."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "So much more death..."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I used to think Rhodes Island fought for the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "But now I see all the dead at our feet, they're all Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Amiya..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Why does Rhodes Island fight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "Now you ask?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#9",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Blaze."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_017_homura_3#5",
            "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Blaze",
        "text": "...Answer her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Honestly, I ask myself the same question all the time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "We see people, Infected and uninfected, die every day."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "We don't, and we shouldn't fight to stop every death. That would be meaningless in the grand scheme of things."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Like now... like in this battle in front of us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "It wasn't one crossbow, one Art, one explosion, or one wound that causes all the death."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "What we fight to defeat is the source of all of this... the hatred the uninfected have for the Infected, and vice versa, is the reason they kill each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "We must tear up the soil that nurtures the hate. Using our pharmaceuticals, and our operations."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_signalbomb"
